ynRWf-MI51F0_l1BrpB2IPrWPLiwFBnhGARM3zc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFSFlQvDZQJFy6_L2GhlONc_MBzl5t4fPclj1CDFCJrw&oe=6B005363"}, {"file_name": "05-player-mauna.png", "id": "29232602573000083", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828028_29232602599666747_7212272778230631290_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3_b2XUIJU8Q7kNvwE4w0RG&_nc_oc=AdqwM71UEiWsbQ8xY-wTTv3kZKsLp9zvWomi6TuZ-HRwJ0sOWYEhJ1wg650hKEjcYp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYcaUE1CBH9ilVkLkSVvEl6NhO9EnvNGtPFqEHHk3NuQ&oe=6B006507"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gala Relax", "keywords": ["galarelax", "relax", "360", "nature", "ambient"], "long_description": "Your quiet place, one scene away.\n\nGala Relax, rebuilt for Meta Quest, puts you inside calming views: waves rolling onto a Hawaiian beach, waterfalls, city skylines at dusk, coral reefs, the coastline from the air. Each scene wraps all around you and loops without a seam, so you can stay as long as you need.\n\n- Seven collections, plus 3D scenes with real depth\n- Download your favorites and unwind offline\n- Seated or standing, no motion, nothing to learn\n- Touch controllers\n\nThe first scene in every collection is free. Go Premium to unlock them all, with a 7-day free trial. Cancel any time in your Meta account.\n\nPurchases from the earlier Gear VR / Go app do not carry over.", "short_description": "Step into the calm. Surf rolling onto a Hawaiian beach, reefs drifting past, the coast from above: 360-degree scenes that wrap all around you and loop for as long as you like. Start free, then unlock every scene with a 7-day free trial."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "STW Software Limited", "support_website_url": "https://gala360.aicam.fun/supp